msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"Press and hold <Action:Button_R2@Chase> to dash, and press <Action:Button_Cross@Chase> to jump.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"You can look behind you with either <Action:Button_L1@Chase> or <Action:Button_R1@Chase>,\r\n"
"but you won't be able to tell what's ahead of you.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Be extra careful not to run into anything when looking back!"
msgstr ""

